From 2281182d50b80bb92565e71a8b5118a23365245a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 15:26:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make UpCloud connect screen look like a plain site login

Drop the upfront "Permit API connections" / 2FA warning from the
connect flow so it reads exactly like logging into upcloud.com: just
username and password, no extra steps mentioned. The technical
requirement still exists on UpCloud's side, so it's surfaced only when
a login actually fails with wrong credentials, as an extra hint under
the normal error message.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NFMuHFMb7r1xEwqxGw4pZn
